<title>USA: Fed says 3-day fixed system RPs totaled $4.034 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says 3-day fixed system RPs totaled $4.034 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve added a total of $4.034 billion in temporary reserves to the banking system in its three-day fixed system repurchase operation on Monday, a New York Fed spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>That follows Friday's over-the-weekend system RPs which totaled $977 million.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1867 ))</p>
